<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caribiner Int'l raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caribiner Int'l raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder upgraded Caribiner International Inc to &quot;outperform significantly&quot; from &quot;outperform,&quot; a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Caribiner gained 2/16 to 33-3/16.</p>
</text>
